0" end="00:14.340">you </span><span begin="00:14.340" end="00:14.370">a </span><span begin="00:14.370" end="00:14.520">little </span><span begin="00:14.520" end="00:15.240">situation </span><span begin="00:15.240" end="00:15.250">.</span><span begin="00:15.250" end="00:15.260">.</span><span begin="00:15.260" end="00:15.270">.</span><span begin="00:15.270" end="00:15.600">listen </span><span begin="00:15.600" end="00:15.600">（</span><span begin="00:15.600" end="00:16.560">fellas</span><span begin="00:16.560" end="00:16.590">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.590" end="00:17.790"><span begin="00:16.590" end="00:16.800">Ya </span><span begin="00:16.800" end="00:16.950">see </span><span begin="00:16.950" end="00:17.100">this </span><span begin="00:17.100" end="00:17.130">*</span><span begin="00:17.130" end="00:17.160">*</span><span begin="00:17.160" end="00:17.190">*</span><span begin="00:17.190" end="00:17.250">* </span><span begin="00:17.250" end="00:17.550">get </span><span begin="00:17.550" end="00:17.790">hot</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.820" end="00:20.070"><span begin="00:17.820" end="00:18.270">Everytime </span><span begin="00:18.270" end="00:18.330">I </span><span begin="00:18.330" end="00:18.600">come </span><span begin="00:18.600" end="00:18.810">through </span><span begin="00:18.810" end="00:19.020">when </span><span begin="00:19.020" end="00:19.080">I </span><span begin="00:19.080" end="00:19.320">step </span><span begin="00:19.320" end="00:19.410">up </span><span begin="00:19.410" end="00:19.500">in </span><span begin="00:19.500" end="00:19.560">the </span><span begin="00:19.560" end="00:19.830">spot </span><span begin="00:19.830" end="00:19.830">（</span><span begin="00:19.830" end="00:19.860">are </span><span begin="00:19.860" end="00:19.920">you </span><span begin="00:19.920" end="00:20.040">ready</span><span begin="00:20.040" end="00:20.070">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.070" end="00:22.080"><span begin="00:20.070" end="