tty </span><span begin="00:27.060" end="00:27.330">skin</span><span begin="00:27.330" end="00:27.330">, </span><span begin="00:27.330" end="00:27.540">so </span><span begin="00:27.540" end="00:27.900">gangsta </span><span begin="00:27.900" end="00:27.990">with </span><span begin="00:27.990" end="00:28.050">it </span><span begin="00:28.050" end="00:28.050">（</span><span begin="00:28.050" end="00:28.080">oh</span><span begin="00:28.080" end="00:28.080">, </span><span begin="00:28.080" end="00:28.200">baby</span><span begin="00:28.200" end="00:28.230">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.230" end="00:28.560"><span begin="00:28.230" end="00:28.340">Gimme </span><span begin="00:28.340" end="00:28.450">tha </span><span begin="00:28.450" end="00:28.560">number</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.560" end="00:29.880"><span begin="00:28.560" end="00:28.748">No </span><span begin="00:28.748" end="00:28.936">tricks </span><span begin="00:28.936" end="00:29.124">only </span><span begin="00:29.124" end="00:29.312">diamonds </span><span begin="00:29.312" end="00:29.500">under </span><span begin="00:29.500" end="00:29.688">my </span><span begin="00:29.688" end="00:29.880">sleeve</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.880" end="00:30.630"><span begin="00:29.880" end="00:29.973">But </span><span begin="00:29.973" end="00:30.066">make </span><span begin="00:30.066" end="00:30.159">sure </span><span begin="00:30.159" end="00:30.252">you </span><span begin="00:30.252" end="00:30.345">call </span><span begin="00:30.345" end="00:30.438">before </span><span begin="00:30.438" end="00:30.531">you </span><span begin="00:30.531" end="00:30.630">leave</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.630" end="00:34.950"><span begin="00:30.630" end="00:30.660">I </span><span begin="00:30.660" end="00:30.720">know </span><span begin="00:30.720" end="00:30.840">you </span><span begin="00:30.840" end="00:30.930">like </span><span begin="00:30.930" end="00:30.990">me </span><span begin="00:30.